# Accepted-risk vulnerability ignores for the Trivy image scan.
# Keep in sync with scripts/audit-js.sh — same advisories, same rationale,
# one decision. Every entry needs a justification and a removal condition.

# react-router RSC-mode CSRF (HIGH). The vulnerable code path is React Server
# Components mode, which this app cannot reach — Vision is a Vite SPA
# (<BrowserRouter>/<Routes> only; no SSR, no RSC, no server actions). The only
# patched release is react-router 8.3.0, a major migration tracked in TODO.md
# ("react-router 7→8 migration"). Remove with that bump, together with the
# matching --ignore in scripts/audit-js.sh.
GHSA-qwww-vcr4-c8h2
